  "instructions": "Consumer Reports ratings as structured tools. Products: cr_categories → cr_filters → cr_ratings → cr_product; cr_reliability for brand surveys; cr_search to find a category. Cars: cr_car_search → cr_car, or cr_cars to list. A null score is a session limitation, never an absence of a rating — read auth_state and scores_available, which are typed enums in every response. When the user asks to connect their membership, call cr_sign_in and then cr_auth_status(wait_s=45); never call cr_sign_in unasked.",
